# Layout Components
Page structure and content organization components.
## Page Component
**Location:** `Layout::PageComponent`
Root layout wrapper for pages.
### Parameters
- `title:` - Page title (for SEO)
- `description:` - Meta description
### Features
- Full viewport height
- Tokyo Night background
- Semantic HTML structure
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Layout::PageComponent.new(title: "Home") do %>
  <!-- Page content -->
<% end %>
```
## Section Component
**Location:** `Layout::SectionComponent`
Content sections with optional backgrounds.
### Parameters
- `variant:` - Background variant (`:default`, `:dark`, `:float`)
- `padding:` - Vertical padding size
### Features
- Responsive padding
- Tokyo Night backgrounds
- Full-width containers
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Layout::SectionComponent.new(variant: :dark) do %>
  <h2>Section Title</h2>
  <p>Section content</p>
<% end %>
```
## Grid Component
**Location:** `Layout::GridComponent`
Responsive grid layouts.
### Parameters
- `cols:` - Number of columns (responsive breakpoint object)
- `gap:` - Gap size between items
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Layout::GridComponent.new(
  cols: { default: 1, md: 2, lg: 3 },
  gap: 6
) do %>
  <%= render CardComponent.new(item: item_1) %>
  <%= render CardComponent.new(item: item_2) %>
  <%= render CardComponent.new(item: item_3) %>
<% end %>
```
## Container Component
**Location:** `Layout::ContainerComponent`
Max-width content container with horizontal padding.
### Parameters
- `max_width:` - Maximum width class (`:sm`, `:md`, `:lg`, `:xl`, `:2xl`)
### Features
- Centered content
- Responsive padding
- Configurable max-width
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Layout::ContainerComponent.new(max_width: :xl) do %>
  <!-- Centered content -->
<% end %>
```
## Layout Patterns
### Standard Page Layout
```erb
<%= render Layout::PageComponent.new(title: "Page Title") do %>
  <%= render Layout::ContainerComponent.new do %>
    <%= render Layout::SectionComponent.new do %>
      <!-- Content -->
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
```
### Multi-Section Page
```erb
<%= render Layout::PageComponent.new(title: "Multi-Section") do %>
  <%= render Layout::SectionComponent.new(variant: :default) do %>
    <!-- Section 1 -->
  <% end %>
  <%= render Layout::SectionComponent.new(variant: :dark) do %>
    <!-- Section 2 -->
  <% end %>
  <%= render Layout::SectionComponent.new(variant: :float) do %>
    <!-- Section 3 -->
  <% end %>
<% end %>
```
### Grid with Cards
```erb
<%= render Layout::GridComponent.new(
  cols: { default: 1, md: 2, lg: 3 }
) do %>
  <% @items.each do |item| %>
    <%= render Animations::SlideUpComponent.new do %>
      <%= render Card::BaseComponent.new(item: item) %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
```
